# YOLO in this workspace (bounded)

**Cursor settings (human):** Run mode **Auto-review**, **Allowlist with Sandbox** enabled. Keep **External-File Protection** and **File-Deletion Protection** on. Do not use Run Everything.

- **Run shell without stalling.** Use Shell for git, cargo, gh, docker, `./build`, worktrees, and diagnostics in this repo and sibling worktrees listed in `.cursor/sandbox.json`.
- **NEVER** pass `required_permissions: ["all"]` for `cargo`, `cargo xtask`, `cargo run -p xtask`, or routine `docker`/`gh` in this project. Default sandbox is enough for builds/tests; use `network` for registry/crates/gh and `git_write` for commit/push only. Requesting `all` disables sandbox and ignores `.cursor/sandbox.json` — do not do it.
- **Patch/create/delete files only under this repository root** (the workspace folder Cursor opened). Do not use edit tools on paths outside it. Shell may read/write in `additionalReadwritePaths` for stack worktrees; merge results here when appropriate.
- **Still avoid:** `git config`, `--no-verify`, force-push `main`, stash (project locks), and destructive git unless the user explicitly asked.
